  2. **Expose /metrics through your gateway (read-only)** (H08). Why: The server's /metrics wasn't reachable, so memory and queue findings (cache use, preemption, waiting requests) can't be shown. Expected: Cache use, preemptions and queue length appear in the report. Risk: Metrics reveal load and configuration; restrict access as you would any internal page.
  
